<title>USA: CD Radio names Andrew Greenebaum CFO.</title>
<headline>CD Radio names Andrew Greenebaum CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CD Radio Inc said Monday it names Andrew Greenebaum executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Greenebaum, age 35, fills a position that has been vacant since 1994, according to the company's chairman, David Margolese.</p>
<p>Greenebaum has been with Walt Disney Co since 1989, where he has held senior management positions since 1992, serving most recently as vice president, corporate finance, in charge of corporate and project finance for Disney.</p>
